H("735.d.1.A",3,"During a capstone course, a student revisits their career plan and adds a certification and an internship they still need. This is:","improving a personal career plan with education, skills and experience",["abandoning the plan","copying a classmate's plan","ignoring requirements"],"Career plans are revised as goals clarify.")
