H("735.d.1.B",4,"A student applying for a network technician role should tailor the resume by:","highlighting skills and projects that match the chosen career plan",["listing every job ever held","adding unrelated awards only","leaving out experience"],"Tailoring ties the resume to the target job.")
H("735.d.1.C",3,"At an interview for an IT help desk job, a strong candidate:","answers clearly, gives examples and asks thoughtful questions",["avoids eye contact","interrupts the interviewer","gives one-word answers"],"Good interviews show communication and preparation.")
H("735.d.1.C",4,"Before an IT interview, the best preparation is to:","research the company and rehearse answers with examples",["skip research","memorize a random script","arrive late on purpose"],"Preparation shows interest and skill.")
