H("735.d.2.B",3,"A technician calculates how many gigabytes are needed for 40 users at 25 GB each. This uses:","mathematics in developing a service",["art skills","music skills","cooking skills"],"Math supports capacity planning.")
H("735.d.2.B",4,"A service plan needs 4 servers at 2.5 TB each. Total storage needed is:","10 TB",["6.5 TB","1.6 TB","100 TB"],"4 × 2.5 TB = 10 TB.")
H("735.d.2.C",3,"Choosing a fan and heat sink so a server stays cool relies on:","science principles about heat transfer",["only paint color","only logo placement","only box size"],"Thermal science guides cooling design.")
H("735.d.2.C",4,"An IT designer knows that electrical resistance produces heat. This science principle affects the design of:","cooling and power systems",["font choices","email subject lines","printer paper"],"Resistance and heat drive power and cooling design.")
H("735.d.3.A",3,"A capstone student notices employees keep losing files because backups fail. Naming that issue is:","identifying a problem relating to information technology",["solving the problem","ignoring the problem","publishing the solution"],"Problem identification starts the process.")
