H("735.d.3.B",3,"A researcher starts with the overall system, then breaks it into smaller parts. This is a:","top-down approach",["bottom-up approach","random approach","backward approach"],"Top-down begins with the big picture.")
H("735.d.3.B",4,"A researcher who first studies individual components and then builds toward the whole system uses a:","bottom-up approach",["top-down approach","hybrid ignoring parts","one-step approach"],"Bottom-up starts with components.")
H("735.d.4.A",3,"After weighing options for a failing backup system, the team picks a solution using resources, IT concepts and industry standards. This is applying:","critical-thinking strategies to develop a solution",["guessing","copying","ignoring data"],"Critical thinking builds sound solutions.")
H("735.d.4.A",4,"A critical thinker evaluating a proposed IT fix will:","check evidence, alternatives and standards before deciding",["accept the first idea","ignore standards","rely on opinion"],"Evidence guides decisions.")
H("735.d.4.B",3,"A team uses a weighted decision matrix to choose between three backup products. This is a:","decision-making technique",["design flaw","delay tactic","security breach"],"Decision matrices compare options.")
