H("735.d.4.C",4,"A good explanation of a proposed solution connects:","the solution's features to the problem's causes",["unrelated features","random facts","only the cost"],"Clear logic persuades.")
H("735.d.5.A",3,"Throughout the capstone, the student meets regularly with an industry expert who reviews the design. This is:","working closely with a mentor",["working alone","avoiding feedback","changing mentors daily"],"Mentors guide design and implementation.")
H("735.d.5.A",4,"The biggest benefit of mentor feedback during implementation is that it:","catches mistakes early and improves quality",["replaces all work","eliminates testing","removes deadlines"],"Mentors improve results.")
H("735.d.5.B",3,"A student builds a small client-ticketing app to meet a specified need using a problem-solving strategy. This is:","developing a product to meet a need",["copying a product","avoiding design","deleting a plan"],"Needs drive product design.")
H("735.d.5.B",4,"A problem-solving strategy used in product development includes defining the problem, planning, building and:","testing and refining the solution",["hiding the product","skipping review","ending early"],"Test and refine completes the loop.")
