H("735.d.5.E",4,"Which item belongs in a sustainability plan for a service?","a schedule for updates, support and funding",["a list of favorite colors","a staff birthday list","a logo draft"],"Long-term support is essential.")
H("735.d.5.F",3,"To learn whether clients are happy with a new service, the student creates a short survey. This is part of:","an evaluation method for client satisfaction",["a hardware repair","a license purchase","a design flaw"],"Surveys measure satisfaction.")
